@startuml
title Metro Parking Service - Current Context and Extension Point
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Web / Mobile Client" as User

rectangle "Metro Mobility Service" as App {
  component "Car Park / Parking" as Parking
  component "Shared API / Security" as Api
  component "Persistence" as Store
}

cloud "Transport for NSW Car Park API" as ParkingProvider
cloud "Trip Planner API (future)" as TripProvider
cloud "Toll Calculator API (future)" as TollProvider
database "MongoDB" as Mongo

User --> Api : HTTPS requests
Api --> Parking
Parking --> ParkingProvider : live + historical occupancy
Parking --> Store
Store --> Mongo

note right of TripProvider
  Future capability only. Model and integrate after
  the car park contract and backend structure settle.
end note
@enduml
